 newobj←AddRefToComp(obj name);refobj;refmask;refname;refpath

 refmask←∊0≠obj.allOf.(⎕NC'⍙⍙36⍙ref')
 refname←(refmask/obj.allOf).⍙⍙36⍙ref
 refpath←'.'@('/'∘=)'_'@('-'∘=)⊃refname
 refobj←obj.##.##.##⍎2↓refpath

 newobj←⊃(obj.allOf/⍨~refmask)

 ⍝ Add properties
 newobj.required,←refobj.required
 newobj.properties{⍺.{⍎⍺,'←⍵'}/⍵}¨↓{n,⍪⍵⍎¨n←⍵.⎕NL ¯9}refobj.properties
